<title>JAPAN: Sakura Bank to alter rules on repurchases -- paper.</title>
<headline>Sakura Bank to alter rules on repurchases -- paper.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sakura Bank Ltd plans to change its company rules to make it easier for it to buy back up to 350 million of its own shares, the business daily Nihon Keizai Shimbun said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Sakura officials were not immediately available to confirm the report.</p>
</text>
